# Misc
# scripts/ is excluded, but four files run inside the image as part of `yarn build`:
# check-site-url.mjs as `prebuild`, and the bundle budget chained after `next build`.
# 🔴 Every re-included path needs its own `!` line — `!scripts/lib/bundle-budget.mjs`
# is not covered by the entry above it, and a missing line does not fail the build
# context: the file is simply absent, and `RUN yarn build` dies on ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND
# only inside the image, where neither `yarn ci` nor `ci.yml` would ever see it.
scripts
!scripts/check-site-url.mjs
!scripts/bundle-budget.mjs
!scripts/lib/bundle-budget.mjs
!scripts/bundle-baseline.json
*.log
.cache
